// The difficulty curve: how strong the run's enemy is, by the battle's number, in reference fighters
// (data::etalon — the enemy is the army that many of them beat half the time). The same for every run, whatever the
// player's army: a stronger army wins more often. docs/BALANCE.md, «Кривая сложности».
(
    // battles 1..15 (the 5th, 10th and 15th are bosses), for a player of each class
    foundry: [6.0, 6.5, 7.0, 7.5, 8.0, 8.5, 9.0, 9.5, 10.0, 10.5, 11.0, 11.5, 12.0, 12.5, 13.0],
    swarm: [10.0, 11.0, 12.0, 13.0, 14.0, 15.0, 16.0, 17.0, 18.0, 19.0, 20.0, 21.0, 22.0, 22.0, 23.0],
    // on top of the battle's own: a dangerous road, an elite, a boss
    danger: 1.2,
    elite: 1.3,
    boss: 1.4,
)
